  id: 
  playerChoiceText: 'What kind of hustle are you talking about? '
  lines:
  - speaker: Mandla
    text: Listen, I got a job you can knock out fast. Tonight. Fence job
  - speaker: Player
    text: That sounds dangerous.
  - speaker: Mandla
    text: "Cut the perimeter fence at the old depot. We \u2018borrow\u2019 some supplies.
      R75 cash"
  - speaker: Player
    text: "R75\u2026 that could feed me for a bit."
  - speaker: Mandla
    text: "Yeah, it\u2019s sketchy. You\u2019ll be looking over your shoulder."
  - speaker: Player
    text: I hate having to even think about this..
  - speaker: Mandla
    text: Do you want R75 or go hungry?
